We drink tea and I begin my story.
"My story starts at the airport," I say.
"It was a January night."
Amit asks, "Maya, how was that first day?"
"It was a very long day," I answer.
"I came out of the airport."
"I had two very heavy bags."
"I was very tired."
"I went near a taxi."
"I looked at the taxi driver."
"I gave him a piece of paper."
"The address of my new home was on that paper."
"I said, 'Brother, I need to go to this address.'"
"At that time, I was very nervous."
"But he looked at the paper and he smiled."
"I put my heavy bags in the taxi."
"Then I sat in the taxi."
Neha laughs and says, "An absolutely filmy story!"
Sanjay also smiles while drinking his tea.
I continue my story.
